go-to: catholic_demands

@grand_coalition
title: [? if (socialist_catholic_coalition_r >= 50) or (centre_left_coalition_r >= 50) : Refuse to form a government, and let the other parties assume responsibility. ?][? if (socialist_catholic_coalition_r < 50) and (centre_left_coalition_r < 50) : We are unable to form a government. The task is handed over to the Liberals. ?]
view-if: centre_right_coalition_r < 50 and anti_socialist_coalition_r < 50
subtitle: PSRI + PPI + [+ ldr_name +] + [+ ul_name +] + [+ ds_name +] + Others [? if pll_formed :+ PLL?]: ([+ grand_coalition_r +]%). 
go-to: grand_coalition_yes if (socialist_catholic_coalition_r < 50) or (centre_left_coalition_r < 50 and ul_allies) or ((centre_left_coalition_r + ul_seating_disp < 50) and (not ul_allies)) or not_participating = 1

Are we sure we wish to give up our opportunity to form the government?

- @grand_coalition_yes: Yes, we will abdicate our responsibility for government formation, and let a coalition without us take power.
- @coalition_menu: Actually, we wish to form a coalition after all.

@centre_right_coalition
